WEBVTT

00:00:59.388 --> 00:01:02.100
as we struggle to adapt
to the unnatural pace

00:01:02.141 --> 00:01:03.518
and scale of change.

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:09.565
My homelands, known as Nitassinan,
are also experiencing these changes.

00:01:10.108 --> 00:01:13.903
It is a harsh, but strikingly beautiful
part of the boreal forest.

00:01:14.278 --> 00:01:17.615
Nitassinan is at its best when it is cold.

00:01:18.282 --> 00:01:23.788
Yet, we are seeing extreme changes in ice
and in key species such as caribou.

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:27.166
When I first drove into Labrador
two decades ago,

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.086
I had to stop on the 
Trans-Labrador Highway for hours